<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>粘贴首节点与后续节点的上边界</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../canvas-paste-upper-boundary.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="粘贴首节点与后续节点的上边界">粘贴首节点与后续节点的上边界</h1><ul>
<li>源码确认：<code>analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmModuleBaseDecorator.cs</code> 的 <code>PasteItemsCommandExecute</code> 对首个模块的非 <code>(0,0)</code> 目标点只按 5 格取整、负值改为 5；后续模块才用 <code>DiagramPageWidth - 150</code> 限幅。<code>(0,0)</code> 键盘哨兵仍先将复制起点加 100 并限幅。<code>Position</code> setter 直接保存给模块，无第二层限幅。</li>
<li>独立实现：画布菜单点的首个复制节点保留靠右/下边界的实际位置，后续节点分别限到 4850；只改粘贴事务，未改移动或拖放坐标策略。</li>
<li>WPF 验收：<code>dotnet run --project tests/VisionEditor.CanvasPasteChecks/VisionEditor.CanvasPasteChecks.csproj -c Release</code>。真实窗口菜单粘贴在 <code>(4901,4923)</code>，首节点成为 <code>(4900,4925)</code>、后续节点 <code>(4850,4850)</code>；两节点为一次事务，撤销/重做和保存重开均通过。截图 <code>analysis/full-audit/canvas-paste-upper-boundary.png</code> 已目检：首节点在画布边缘可发生裁切，这与原始定位公式相符。</li>
<li>未验原生：真实 VM 桌面同状态菜单输入与像素差分、原始复制字典枚举在复杂选择中的首节点顺序。</li>
</ul>
<p class="meta">来源：docs/canvas-paste-upper-boundary.md · SHA256 c866ca2dd93eff2dc43a57ce33054b90955b4c3820243745e6d00fc198b4ae42<br>本页只转换阅读格式，结论与历史进度保留原文。</p></main></html>